        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While the core technology of our products has been critical to our Company’s historical success and will remain important in the future, we continue to invest in opportunities to develop innovative technology encompassing both the Hydraulics and Electronics segments to create new products to address future market trends and further diversify our end markets.",
        "start_character": 17258,
        "end_character": 17618
